@q 56:114-115

**Antioxidants** (vitamins C and E, beta-carotene, selenium) neutralise **free radicals**. **Urochrome** gives urine its yellow colour. In **dehydration** the body loses water and **salt (sodium chloride)**; **ORS** replaces both, and **sea water** makes it worse. **Cellulose** is the most abundant organic compound on Earth, and **fructose** makes fruits sweet.

